Z||000000||matt300ZX||11-26-2001||05:45 PM||||on any forum. Except of course for a few but I came in here a little harsh and you all responded really cool. I am completely ignorant to the fact that there is a following of this car. Now I am interested and want to learn why you guys love this car so much. You all seem to have the same ethusiasm as we do over on twinturbo.net (for 300ZX owners) <A HREF="http://pages.prodigy.net/peter_wierzba/ttnet/" TARGET=_blank>http://pages.prodigy.net/peter_wierzba/ttnet/</A> <BR>Above is a link to a couple of pics of my car. Not good pics at all but I am getting a digital camera soon w/ better pics. Also this car was originally owned by Walter Payton. I have to sell it now b/c I got laid off in August I am so sad.||||reg||1
