Z||000014||tomcat06085||11-26-2001||06:53 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DaRkLoRD:<BR><B>I love 300ZXs... wish I could afford one of those too.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>My brother is selling his 300ZX...1985, pretty sure on the year. It was his wife's car for 10 years and she's had an SUV for the last 12 years or so. He pretty much stored it in a garage and drove it on nice days to break up the Lincoln TownCar routine. It was like new, but last year he had the paint and trim, along with wheels, tires, brakes, interior redone to absolute perfection. He asked me what he should ask and since I appreciated the Nissan sportscars since the Datsun 2000 beat up the Triumphs, MGB's and everything else in it's class, told him he should ask at least $10,000. Anybody interested, email me. He doesn't need the car, likes it, but likes his SUV better. The car is really nice. If anybody is interested, I'll get some pics.<P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://jrreeves.com/images/blckfire.jpg"> <BR>tomcat...Thanks for the help!||||reg||10
