Z||000026||FieroKyle||11-26-2001||10:37 PM||||Not a bad looking car at all. Sorry to here about your job, it always sucks. I got laid off at a golfcourse couple years ago. I go do donuts in their gravel parking lot to better keep my cool.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> LoL<P>Glad to hear your interest in Fieros. They about come anyway ya could want one. Its Americas last great street rod in my opinion. Fast outta the box but yet has lots of potential.<P>Find one, drive one, look at your options and money situation. I can grauntee that you'll get an itch to own one, its truly different but a blast of a car. Also to like ya gotta like an underdog though, almost comes with owning one. Anyways good luck in your ventures.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierokylesig_1.gif">      <P>My Fast 'n Black Car<BR>Kyle - 85' GT||||reg||1
